{{!
    @template local_coursegen/local/courseai/guideline_preview

    Body of the institutional guideline preview dialogue (core/modal) on the
    course AI creation page. Rendered from JavaScript, so the visible strings
    are passed in as context by the caller.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * category string        - Guideline category label (falls back to "General" in the caller)
    * fullcontexttext string - Subtitle explaining that the full content is sent to the AI
    * description string     - Full guideline content, rendered as plain text

    Example context (json):
    {
        "category": "General",
        "fullcontexttext": "Complete content that will be sent to AI as context.",
        "description": "All courses must include a welcome forum."
    }
}}
<div class="guideline-preview">
    <div class="preview-subtitle">
        <span class="preview-cat-badge">{{category}}</span>
        <span class="preview-subtitle-text">{{fullcontexttext}}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="preview-desc-box">
        <p>{{description}}</p>
    </div>
</div>
